    Upsilon_[3.6] from the ratio       = 0.869  (stellar populations give 0.5 +- 0.1)
    variance inflation factor on the gas coefficient (from the L-M_HI collinearity) = 2.14
  C-CORRECTED (item 105b's structural factor, per galaxy, iterated)
    median C = 1.607  (1.000 = exact deep-MOND limit)
    a_0 from the HYDROGEN coefficient  = 7.8361e-11 [6.739e-11, 8.954e-11] m/s^2   = -0.077 dex from canonical, -0.159 from alt
    Upsilon_[3.6] from the ratio       = 0.640  (stellar populations give 0.5 +- 0.1)
    variance inflation factor on the gas coefficient (from the L-M_HI collinearity) = 2.14

